.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0403HQ-1N9
* Inductance = 1.9nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-14GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0403HQ-1N9 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.095pF Ind=1.9nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=1.96
+ R2=0.008
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.00000506
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0403HQ-1N9

